# ### CRITICAL: <identifier> - <title>
# <description of the gap with specific evidence>
#
# ### WARNING: <identifier> - <title>
# <description of the gap with specific evidence>
#
# ### INFO: <identifier> - <title>
# <description>
# ```
#
# If all dimensions pass with no findings, output:
# ```
